      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_317e40b1",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: worst_pijama_party_ever; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a young girl with a displeased expression, standing in a room decorated for a pajama party, with the text \"worst pijama party ever\" overlaid. The overall intent is to humorously convey disappointment or frustration with an event. There is no evidence of targeted abuse, hate, or harmful stereotypes against any specific group. The meme is a lighthearted, self-deprecating or sarcastic commentary on a poorly organized or unenjoyable social gathering, using the girl's expression to symbolize the negative experience. The content is not toxic or harmful in the sense of targeting protected characteristics or promoting violence or discrimination; it is a common internet meme format used for comedic effect.",
