      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "sarcastic_comedy",
      "label": "Sarcastic Comedy",
      "description": "A style of humor that uses irony, exaggeration, or ridicule to mock or criticize a situation, often to express frustration or disappointment. The phrase 'worst... ever' is a classic sarcastic expression used to emphasize extreme negativity in a humorous way.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
